Files are vendored UNMODIFIED and keep their upstream names: <id>-relaxation.svg is the
start position of the movement, <id>-tension.svg the end. <id> is the zero-padded `id_num`
from the upstream exercises.json.

Only the subset referenced by src/session/exercise-illustrations.ts is vendored, not the
full upstream set. To add one, copy both frames from the commit above and add the mapping
entry — see that file's header for the rule on when a drawing may be mapped.

ShareAlike: any MODIFIED version of these drawings (recoloured, restyled, cropped, or
converted to another format) is a derivative work and must itself be distributed under
CC BY-SA 4.0. Attribution is carried on the exercise preview screen and in src/about.
